      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2023-11-15T12:07:39.150Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A Sales Order will always show status “overdue” when no Delivery Note was submitted, even after the Sales Invoice was paid. While that makes sense with goods it is not quite so necessary with services.</p>\n<p>Is there a way to unlink the Delivery Note from the workflow, so Sales Orders change to closed after the payment is received?</p>\n<p>Cheers,<br>\nKonrad</p>",
