      "created_at": "2023-11-15T13:08:58.652Z",
      "cooked": "<p>digging deeper, I found this in Selling Settings:<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/6/0620d4169728335f1672fb2e65880846657a214e.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"SdcmRa1qTf6bEVWCXWI7e36mZM\" width=\"573\" height=\"94\"></p>\n<p>I would guess that “No” means “don’t worry about a Delivery Note being made or not” and also “don’t rely on it” for the Sales Order’s status.</p>\n<p>Did I miss something?</p>",
