      "id": 384093,
      "username": "aa_prashant",
      "name": "PRASHANT AGRAWAL",
      "created_at": "2023-11-17T21:31:37.189Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In Simplest form <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/kombi\">@kombi</a></p>\n<p>Your sales order is asking if you have actually delivered the items or not. and that will only happen if your items have been moved out of your stock.</p>\n<p>if you do not want to make a delivery note, Check ‘Update Stock’ in your sales invoice.</p>\n<p>PS:- If it is a service item then it won’t say overdue <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/grinning.png?v=12\" title=\":grinning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grinning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/aa_prashant/{size}/61747_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 10,
      "post_type": 1,
